Similar to the above PWAS weight calculation section, a modified version of FUSION11 was used, as for the same metabolites associated with more than one genetic region, all variants from each region were included in the weight calculation. The same covariates used for mQTL identification were used for MWAS weight calculation. The SNP-based heritability of each metabolite was estimated using the GCTA GREML52 tool. The metabolites with negative h2 values were removed before performing the weight calculation. The window size of the sentinel QTL region was \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
